BEGIN_DESC
A DeltaGlider closes on the stock ISS in Earth orbit. The exterior camera follows the glider, switches focus to the station, then returns to the glider. Start the simulation unpaused to run the 28-second sequence.
END_DESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Script ISSApproach
  Date MJD 51982.0975169074
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship DG-01
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET DG-01
  MODE Extern
  POS 6.83 52.96 -13.52
  TRACKMODE GlobalFrame
  FOV 60.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_HUD
  TYPE Orbit
END_HUD

BEGIN_MFD Left
  TYPE Docking
END_MFD

BEGIN_MFD Right
  TYPE Orbit
  PROJ Ship
  REF Earth
  TARGET ISS
END_MFD

BEGIN_VC
END_VC

